      "$\\frac{d^3 y}{dx^3} = \\sqrt[3]{1 + \\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right)^4}$",
      "$\\left[\\frac{d^2 y}{dx^2} - 5\\right]^{3/2} = \\frac{dy}{dx} + 1$",
